        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: Orgasmic platform, human sexual response, sexual disorders, sexual dysfunctions\n- People: William H. Masters, Virginia E. Johnson\n- Organizations: Masters and Johnson research team\n\nFacts:\n- From 1957 until the 1990s, the Masters and Johnson research team pioneered research into the nature of human sexual response and the diagnosis and treatment of sexual disorders and dysfunctions.\n- The Masters and Johnson research team was composed of William H. Masters and Virginia E. Johnson.\n- The orgasmic platform is the tissues of the outer third of the vagina.\n- Masters and Johnson labeled the tissues of the outer third of the vagina as the orgasmic platform.",
